Lean proofs
Maintained by threebylee.

The formalizations were developed with assistance from OpenAI Codex.
Mathematical source attribution is given in each proof directory.
The problem definitions originate from the Conjectures.io task sources and the Formal Conjectures project.
The proofs use Mathlib v4.27.0 (Apache License 2.0); Mathlib and Lean are fetched as dependencies, not vendored here.
Some elementary constructions adapt Mathlib arguments; in-source references are retained.
Publication does not assert first discovery, first formalization, or bounty eligibility.
